      "content": "i did talk to someone but they just brushed it off as stress or something... like they didnt get it at all. it doesnt feel like stress. it feels like my body is actually recalibrating. like my nervous system is unlocking some kind of dormant capacity. if this is happening, i don't want to just wait for it, i want to lean into it. how can i create an environment that helps my brain process all this new input without getting overwhelmed?",
